\section{Profile}
Systems Engineer with 25+ years of experience building and scaling
high-availability Linux infrastructure, including 15+ years writing production
C and Go code.  Proven track record scaling Cloudflare’s global authoritative
DNS routing and holding a co-invented cloud networking patent.  Core maintainer
and long-term contributor to critical Linux system utilities (util-linux,
iputils/ping) running on billions of devices worldwide.  Available immediately.

\section{Highlights}
\begin{itemize}
\itemsep 0em
\item Over \textbf{1,800 merged patches} to util-linux since 2010, and a
      fixed \href{https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2015-5218}{CVE} in
      that codebase.
\item Maintains \textbf{ping} for the iputils project, and is an official
      maintainer of \textbf{GNU Hello}.
\item Over \textbf{3,500 accepted open source contributions} across around
      40 projects since 2009.
\item Co-inventor, with \textit{Marwan Fayed} and \textit{Pavel Odintsov},
      on a \href{https://patents.justia.com/patent/12375442}{Cloudflare
      patent} for decoupling IP address bindings in a distributed cloud
      network.
\item Worked on Cloudflare's authoritative DNS routing.  Built and ran a DNS
      platform serving over 20,000 domains at TeliaSonera.
\item Wrote \href{https://dhcpd-pools.sourceforge.net/}{dhcpd-pools} from
      scratch and has maintained it since 2006, using autoconf, automake,
      static analysis tools, gdb, valgrind and perf.
\end{itemize}

